---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Digital Solutions and Services">
  <div class="py-8">
    <div class="mb-6 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight">Digital Solutions and Services</h1>
      <h2 class="text-lg md:text-3xl font-light text-gray-700">
        Working with public sector organizations to design, prototype, and build better
        services
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
      <div class="flex-grow max-w-5xl">
        <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            For the last nine years, Code for Pakistan has been on a mission to build a
            non-partisan civic innovation ecosystem in Pakistan. In this mission to
            advance digital governance and civic engagement, Code for Pakistan has
            partnered with different public and private sector organizations to develop
            citizen-centric technology solutions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our approach to solutions development is always user-centric, employing
            human-centered design and design thinking methodologies to develop and design
            the most optimal solution for the intended end users.
          </p>
          <p>
            Over the years, we have partnered with more than 45 government departments
            across the federal and provincial levels, developing 70+ digital solutions and
            services to simplify citizen access to government services and make the
            government more accessible, open and transparent.
          </p>
          <p>
            In addition, we have partnered with different local and international civil
            society organizations and created custom solutions for different social
            initiatives.
          </p>
          <p>
            Contact us today to partner in developing technology solutions for civic needs.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
</MainLayout>




